WEBVTT

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:02.150
A dream?

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.240
Eichi-kun?

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.630
I'll be fine, right?

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:28.630
Sure.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.280
Mitsuki-san.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.900
How many times have I told you to stop doing that.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.910
Music is such a vile thing.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.410
It reminds me of your parents.

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:54.740
It makes me feel bad.

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:55.910
I'm very sorry.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:56.660
But I...

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:57.830
Don't talk back!

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:00.000
Okay...

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.670
Has your fever gone down?

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:03.540
Yes.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.630
Is that so?

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:05.960
That's good.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:09.420
Dr. Wakaouji is here to see you.

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:10.720
Come out to the kitchen.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:12.390
Wakaouji-sensei!

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:14.720
Sorry for calling you in during your vacation.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:15.760
No, no.

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:16.770
Please don't worry about it.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:18.770
So, how's her health?

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:20.890
She seems to be doing much better this morning.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:22.400
Really?

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.560
Good morning, Mitsuki-chan.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.020
Good morning!

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:33.270
It seems like your tumor's swelled up a bit.

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.300
Is it okay if I apply treatment on it?

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.200
Yes, please.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:38.630
All right, all done!

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.210
Thank you very much.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.200
Um... Wakaouji-sensei.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.130
What is it, Mitsuki-chan?

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:50.510
Can you pretend that you're 
taking me to the hospital today?

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:53.010
You need an excuse to get out of the house, huh?

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.550
So, where do you plan on going?

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:57.970
Ta-da!

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:00.850
Seed Records' Debut Artists Audition!

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:03.810
Notification of Passing the First Review!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:04.520
Huh?

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:09.150
I'm keeping it a secret from Grandma, so...

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:09.860
No way.

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:10.940
Aww...

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.240
You just had a fever yesterday and 
had to leave school early, right?

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:15.240
You have a tumor in your throat.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:17.330
As your doctor, I can't allow you to do that.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.290
But I finally managed to get past the first review...

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:21.750
In your current condition...

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.540
...you can't sing in a loud voice, can you?

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.840
You can think about auditioning 
after your throat gets better.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.200
Mitsuki-chan.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.890
While the tumor is still small, let's try an operation.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.680
I don't want any surgery.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:38.510
Because...

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:40.930
I might lose my voice, right?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.440
That's because of its location.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:46.210
I can't guarantee that it won't happen.

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:47.150
If that's the case...

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:48.480
...I don't want to be operated on.

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:50.190
Sensei...

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:53.030
What's even more terrifying than dying...

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:55.360
...is not being able to sing for the rest of my life.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:56.640
That's why...

00:05:58.910 --> 00:05:59.950
I'm sorry.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.310
Mitsuki-chan...

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.600
Um... it's about Mitsuki-chan...

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.290
About her operation...

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:08.880
...could you possibly convince 
her to go through with it?

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:10.760
I've already suggested it time and time again.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:11.380
But...

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.550
...she still refuses to listen.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:14.680
For heaven's sake.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.130
She's just as stubborn as my late daughter was.

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:18.800
She is unable to give in!

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:20.600
I see...

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.230
Another failure...

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:33.360
I wonder if I'll have to wait 
until my throat gets better...

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:57.860
But...

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:00.780
...just when will that happen...

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.640
...Eichi-kun?

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:12.570
All right.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:16.560
W-Who are you?

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.550
How'd you come out of the wall?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:21.480
This one, huh?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.910
Kouyama Mitsuki, age 12.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:23.540
Huh?

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.000
Why does he know my name?

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:28.210
Wait a minute, Takuto.

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:33.170
Because you're too slow.

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.460
Hey there.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:37.090
Is that the attitude you should 
have towards your elder?

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.470
You don't have to bring up your
seniority all the time, you know?

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:40.180
What?!

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:41.430
E-Excuse me.

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:44.640
Who might... you be?

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.930
You... can see us?

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:48.310
Yup.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.690
Humans who are still living 
shouldn't be able to see us, right?!

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:56.110
But...I can see you.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:58.740
What do we do in a situation like this?

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.360
If it's come to this, we have no choice.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:00.990
Let's do this!

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:01.450
Yeah!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.450
It's absurd to remain unknown 
when our cover is blown.

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:08.200
We are the Shinigami, the ones who silence the tears of children.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.080
Takuto!

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:10.120
Meroko!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.590
You call yourselves Spring Onion Ramen!

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:22.220
Sounds tasty!

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:22.840
Takuto...

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:25.220
I really can't stand our duo's name.

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:26.100
Deal with it.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:27.560
Our chief chose it after all.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:31.310
Bunny ears and kitty ears.

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:32.400
So soft...

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:34.480
These are used for treating children...

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:35.610
Treating children?

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.320
Shinigami have kids, too?

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.690
Eh...kids?

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:41.820
Now that I think about it, if you're Shinigami...

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:44.320
Did you come to pick me up?

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.160
That's what we're here for.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:48.160
You're not supposed to say that!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.290
It's too late for that.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.210
Am I going to die today?

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.250
Just pretend you didn't hear that.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:54.000
You're not supposed to die for one more year.

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:55.130
One more year?

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:57.550
Is it because...

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.630
...my cancer gets worse?

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.260
Well, that's probably why.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:02.630
Ah... sorry.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:04.090
Please, don't cry.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:06.890
She's not crying.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.770
Well, while we have the chance...

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.350
Let's see...

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:11.270
In times like this...

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:11.520
Um...

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:13.190
Here...

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:15.550
Actually...

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:18.110
...there are people who are 
trying to prevent your death.

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:20.070
Then...

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:21.540
...I'm not going to die?

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.120
No.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:22.900
That's forbidden.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.910
Fate cannot be altered.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:26.070
I see.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:35.380
Hey, Takuto...

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:37.650
Going on and on and on and on...

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.200
...just what are you trying to do?!

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.460
I'm going to report this to the chief.

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:43.240
It doesn't matter, does it?

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:44.590
Besides, we've already been seen.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:46.930
<i>So what </i> if another year passes, she...

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:47.800
Huh?

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:51.160
Where'd she go?

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:58.360
Takuto, over there!

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:00.360
Wait, little kid!

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:01.690
Stop right there!

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:06.570
Hey, you!

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:08.990
Wait up!

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:11.950
Taxi!

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.500
Goddamn it!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.190
Just when I had almost caught up to her!

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:21.590
Get out of the way!

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:22.710
I-Idiot!

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:50.990
Is this the place?

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.040
Where'd she run off to?

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:19.730
We thought she was a good girl, so...

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:20.860
...we let her get away.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.110
Oh, she's over there!

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:22.730
Really?

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:25.240
I wonder what she's doing?

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.150
Does it matter?

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:28.680
Hey, wait.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.660
If you just go up to her like that, 
she'll just run away again.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.160
Heh, I know that.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:34.950
Geez.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.500
Why won't it open?

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.230
Is there a key around somewhere?

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:41.670
I can get in through there!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:42.880
All right!

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:44.390
I'll have to get up there then!

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:44.930
Yep!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.360
They're so cute!

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.970
What are these?

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.530
I wonder if they're decorations?

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:55.910
They seem a little... out of place.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.940
We caught you.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.730
Ah... Sh-Shinigami-san.

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:08.860
It's troublesome for us when 
 you go running off like this.

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:10.990
Now, be a good girl and come 
back to the house with us.

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:11.740
Yep, yep.

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:13.640
P-Please wait a minute!

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:15.740
I want to go through the audition!

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:18.410
I don't want to just go home like this!

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:19.290
Then...

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.540
...why were you trying to go in from there?

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:22.460
That's right.

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:23.710
Why don't you just go in through the front door?

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:24.880
I can't...

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.090
...because I don't look like I'm sixteen.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:29.380
Do I look like I'm sixteen?

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.430
Well...

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:31.340
...no, not really.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:34.430
So I should...

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:36.210
... go up through here after all.

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:37.770
Let go, stupid! It's dangerous!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:40.020
What if you get hurt?

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:40.730
But...

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:43.590
...if I don't hurry, the audition will be over.

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.770
I... have to become a singer-

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.150
Did something happen?

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.910
Talking... loudly...

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:52.860
I can't...

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:54.280
My throat...

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:57.620
Then, isn't it impossible for you to audition?

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:58.620
But...

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:00.670
Please...

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:02.620
...if I only have one year left to live...

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:04.780
...please, at least let me audition.

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.280
If I fail...

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.000
...I'll be a good girl and listen to you.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.630
So...

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:11.820
...please!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.050
You're serious about this, huh?

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:16.890
I get it.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.980
I'll make you sixteen years old.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.150
And then, as long as you are sixteen...

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:31.820
...I'll make it so that your body is healthy as well.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:37.910
Take it.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.290
On my command...

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:42.870
...that will begin spreading inside your body.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.540
You'll feel weird, but...

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:45.580
...you'll just have to endure it.

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.550
That's a good girl.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.330
You can't feel the difference?

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.430
Check yourself over there then?

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.630
Thank you, Shinigami-san!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.300
Thank you so much!

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:38.180
Hey!

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:39.720
Get away from Takuto!

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:40.810
Are you satisfied?

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:43.350
Well... I want to try dying my hair, too.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.650
What are you doing, Takuto?

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:49.640
What?

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:51.640
You're disobeying orders from above...

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.540
...by letting a human know the truth.

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:55.520
If they find out, you'll be in for it.

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:57.070
Well...

00:14:57.070 --> 00:14:57.570
You couldn't have...

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:58.200
With that girl...

00:14:58.660 --> 00:14:59.410
Huh?

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:00.540
No!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.000
Takuto is mine!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.680
I'll never let you have him!

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:05.960
Since <i>when</i>  did I belong to you?

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.600
Don't worry.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:08.760
It's not like that.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:09.080
Huh?

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:11.540
If she still has regrets in this world

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:12.930
...then, when she dies...

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:15.760
If she refuses to come with us, it'll be a problem.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:17.090
I guess that's true, but...

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:19.470
...what are you going to do if she makes it?

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:20.890
That'll just leave her with even more regrets.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:22.150
It'll be fine.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:24.270
There's no way she can make it just like that.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:27.710
After turning sixteen and going through an audition...

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:30.270
...only to fail and face reality...

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.420
...she won't have a shred of regret left...

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:38.910
Wow...

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.240
Only really cute girls are here.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:11.480
Can I... sit next to you?

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:12.590
Um...

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.670
...sure.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.090
You... what agency are you from?

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:20.410
Agency?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.240
You're not part of any theatrical 
group or a recording agency?

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:23.910
Yeah.

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:31.620
It's really unfortunate, but it's 
 probably impossible for you.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.090
This is just between us.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:37.160
They've already decided on who they're selecting.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:37.920
What?!

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:40.090
Then, why are we auditioning?!

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:44.510
I-I'm very sorry.

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:45.530
Sorry.

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:48.230
Why is that?

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:49.610
This audition gets...

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:53.240
...lots of coverage on the 
 morning news and on talk shows.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:55.230
With all the attention...

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:59.440
...she'll receive from those watching 
her get chosen on television...

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:02.570
...she'll become famous.

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:03.910
Is that so..?

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:07.760
You... already knew that...

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:08.980
Sorry.

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:12.040
Now, what you've all been waiting 
for, the judging is about to begin.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:12.830
Bye, then.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.630
Please come in when your number is called.

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:18.460
To start, will Number 1 please come in...

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.580
Number 21.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.330
Number 21, please come in.

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:59.200
I'm Number 21, Kouyama Mitsuki.

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.760
Pleased to meet you.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:02.410
What genre of music do you like?

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:05.380
I like... Japanese pop.

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:06.720
If you become a singer...

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:08.290
...is there anything in particular you'd like to try?

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:09.560
Well...

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:11.690
Anyways, I'd just want to sing...

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:13.160
...since I love singing.

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:14.520
Why don't you sing for us then.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:15.480
Cue the music.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.230
If she's going to be nervous...

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:23.530
...there's no way she'll make it.

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:32.020
Wait, stop for a second.

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.520
Your voice is too soft.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:35.370
Sing with a louder voice.

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:36.940
Eh... louder?

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.340
Is something wrong with your throat?

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.380
Does it hurt?

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:41.360
I guess it's impossible for you to sing then.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:42.050
Impossible...

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.530
It really was... impossible....

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:48.550
Please excuse me!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:50.250
Are you just going to run away?

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:53.270
Shinigami-san!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.850
Your throat is fine...

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:55.520
Sing.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.810
You love to sing, right?

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.240
I'm very sorry.

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:13.830
Can you please let me try one more time?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.090
Um... sure.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.370
Cue the music, then.

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:51.000
She...

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:03.330
Um...

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:04.730
I'm done...

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:06.770
Call Miya!

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:07.730
Call Ishikawa, too!

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:08.110
Okay...

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:08.730
Nishida!

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:09.910
Send everyone else back!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.320
We've decided on Number 21!

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:11.950
Okay!

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.030
Hey, what should we do about this?!

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.040
Today's audition is over.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:20.250
Although previously expected...

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:22.830
...there will not be a third judging...

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:08.270
What have you done, Takuto?!

00:23:08.270 --> 00:23:10.190
That girl made it, didn't she?!

00:23:10.400 --> 00:23:12.020
Just be quiet... I don't know what happened.

00:23:12.860 --> 00:23:13.860
It couldn't be that...

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.400
...you've fallen in love with that girl?!

00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:17.070
I-It's nothing like that at all!

00:23:17.070 --> 00:23:18.030
But it's no good.

00:23:18.030 --> 00:23:20.870
That girl has someone named 
Eichi-kun, whom she likes a lot.

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:21.910
She's becoming a singer...

00:23:21.910 --> 00:23:24.250
...because of a promise with Eichi-kun.

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:26.200
W-What did you just say?!

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:27.190
That's just wrong!

00:23:27.190 --> 00:23:28.550
It was because of something like <i>that</i> ?!

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:30.630
Next time on Full Moon Wo Sagashite:

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:32.090
The Promise With Eichi-kun.
